# The same 216 MW as 02-more-of-everything, on two thirds of the land, with
# fifteen components instead of seventeen and nothing wasted at all.
#
# Two things changed. The reactor sits in the middle, so all four exchangers
# are within reach of it and the two heat pipes -- and their 2% -- are gone.
# And the throttle is set to what four exchangers can actually swallow, which
# is 800 of its 1000 heat, so the stack is cold.
#
# It is not the smallest answer to the brief. 03-compact is a third of the plot
# for half the power. Which of the two is better depends on something this
# experiment deliberately does not know.

machine "Radial"

reactor   R1  at 4,4  throttle 80

exchanger HX1 at 4,0
exchanger HX2 at 4,8
exchanger HX3 at 0,4
exchanger HX4 at 8,4

pump      W1  at 0,0
pump      W2  at 8,8

turbine   T1  at 8,0
generator G1  at 11,0
turbine   T2  at 8,11
generator G2  at 11,11
turbine   T3  at 0,8
generator G3  at 0,11
turbine   T4  at 11,4
generator G4  at 11,7

wire R1.heat -> HX1.heat
wire R1.heat -> HX2.heat
wire R1.heat -> HX3.heat
wire R1.heat -> HX4.heat

wire W1.water -> HX1.water
wire W1.water -> HX3.water
wire W2.water -> HX2.water
wire W2.water -> HX4.water

wire HX1.steam -> T1.steam
wire HX2.steam -> T2.steam
wire HX3.steam -> T3.steam
wire HX4.steam -> T4.steam

wire T1.rotary -> G1.rotary
wire T2.rotary -> G2.rotary
wire T3.rotary -> G3.rotary
wire T4.rotary -> G4.rotary
